<view class="page-shell reminders-page">
  <view class="large-title">
    <text class="large-title__eyebrow">REVIEW RHYTHM</text>
    <text class="large-title__heading">按你的节奏来。</text>
    <text class="large-title__copy">先控制每天什么时候复习、一次出现多少内容，避免提醒变成负担。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-banner">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{saved}}" class="success-banner">✓ 提醒偏好已经保存</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="ios-card loading-settings">正在读取设置…</view>

  <block wx:else>
    <text class="section-label">每日提醒</text>
    <view class="ios-card settings-group">
      <view class="setting-row">
        <view class="setting-copy"><text>启用复习提醒</text><text>保留提醒时间与队列设置</text></view>
        <switch checked="{{form.enabled}}" color="#34C759" bindchange="onEnabledChange" />
      </view>
      <view class="hairline"></view>
      <picker mode="time" value="{{form.preferred_time}}" disabled="{{!form.enabled}}" bindchange="onTimeChange">
        <view class="setting-row {{!form.enabled ? 'setting-row--disabled' : ''}}">
          <view class="setting-copy"><text>提醒时间</text><text>每天优先开始复习的时间</text></view>
          <view class="setting-value"><text>{{form.preferred_time}}</text><text>›</text></view>
        </view>
      </picker>
      <view class="hairline"></view>
      <view class="limit-setting {{!form.enabled ? 'setting-row--disabled' : ''}}">
        <view class="limit-heading">
          <view class="setting-copy"><text>每日建议上限</text><text>只平衡展示负载，不改 FSRS 到期时间</text></view>
          <text class="limit-value">{{form.daily_limit}} 条</text>
        </view>
        <view class="limit-slider-row">
          <text>1</text>
          <slider
            class="limit-slider"
            min="1"
            max="100"
            step="1"
            value="{{form.daily_limit}}"
            disabled="{{!form.enabled}}"
            activeColor="#007AFF"
            backgroundColor="#D1D1D6"
            block-color="#FFFFFF"
            block-size="24"
            bindchanging="onLimitChanging"
            bindchange="onLimitChange"
          />
          <text>100</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="hairline"></view>
      <view class="setting-row {{!form.enabled ? 'setting-row--disabled' : ''}}">
        <view class="setting-copy"><text>提醒中包含逾期</text><text>关闭后逾期卡仍保留在“全部到期”中</text></view>
        <switch checked="{{form.overdue_enabled}}" disabled="{{!form.enabled}}" color="#34C759" bindchange="onOverdueChange" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="section-label">AI 辅助</text>
    <view class="ios-card settings-group">
      <view class="setting-row">
        <view class="setting-copy"><text>回答后给出 AI 建议</text><text>分析缺失点并建议 1–4 级，你始终拥有最终决定权</text></view>
        <switch checked="{{form.ai_evaluation_enabled}}" color="#34C759" bindchange="onAiEvaluationChange" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="section-label">地区</text>
    <view class="ios-card settings-group">
      <view class="setting-row">
        <view class="setting-copy"><text>时区</text><text>自动读取设备，无法识别时使用亚洲上海</text></view>
        <text class="timezone">{{form.timezone}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="ios-button save-button" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="savePreferences">{{saving ? '正在保存…' : '保存设置'}}</button>

    <text class="section-label">微信订阅提醒</text>
    <view class="ios-card subscription-card">
      <view wx:if="{{!subscriptionStatusAvailable}}" class="subscription-heading">
        <view class="delivery-icon">!</view>
        <view><text>订阅状态暂不可用</text><text>云端服务正在更新，提醒偏好仍可正常保存；部署新版后会自动恢复。</text></view>
      </view>
      <block wx:else>
      <view class="subscription-heading">
        <view class="delivery-icon {{subscription.delivery_enabled ? 'delivery-icon--ready' : ''}}">{{subscription.delivery_enabled ? '✓' : '!'}}</view>
        <view><text>{{subscription.delivery_enabled ? '定时发送已就绪' : '发送服务尚未启用'}}</text><text>{{subscription.template_id ? '每次授权可发送一次到期提醒' : '请先在服务端配置订阅消息模板 ID'}}</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="grant-count"><text>{{subscription.available_grants}}</text><view><text>可用提醒次数</text><text>微信一次性订阅授权会在发送成功后消耗</text></view></view>
      <button class="ios-button subscribe-button" disabled="{{!subscriptionAuthorizationEnabled || subscribing || !subscription.template_id}}" bindtap="requestSubscription">{{subscriptionAuthorizationEnabled ? (subscribing ? '正在请求授权…' : '授权一次复习提醒') : '订阅授权暂未开放'}}</button>
      <text wx:if="{{subscription.last_sent_label}}" class="last-delivery">上次发送：{{subscription.last_sent_label}} · {{subscription.last_delivery_status}}</text>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view class="scope-card">
      <text>提醒边界</text>
      <text>授权必须由你主动点击；云函数按设置时间检查到期卡。发送结果不确定时不会盲目重发，避免重复提醒。</text>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
